<h1 id="ctodo-title" style="color:#0d47a1;font-size:1.5em;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #90caf9;padding-bottom:0.25em;margin-top:0">Idea backlog capture (<code>ctodo</code>)</h1>

**Trigger:** User message contains **`ctodo`** as a **whole-word** token, followed by a **description of ideas** (rest of prompt or quoted block).

**Target file (single ledger):** `docs_manual_gen/todos/TODO_IDEAS_LIST.md`

**Also apply:** Follow **mrkd-markdown-authoring** for any create/edit of that file.

<h2 id="ctodo-outline" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">Document outline</h2>

